  "article_id": "3580480498-2247495087_3",
  "title": "肯尼亚 - 姆央嘎 Kiriti FCS 基里玛希噶 Kirimahiga AA 水洗 - 黑布林、蔓越莓、红布林、葡萄柚",
  "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tivKzCghYHd2_5AflaYyVA",
  "publish_time": 1756639906,
  "status": "body_recovered",
  "extraction_method": "article_dom",
  "body_text": "基本信息\n国家：肯尼亚 Kenya\n省份：中部 Central\n区域：姆央噶 Muranga\n处理厂：基里玛希噶处理厂 Kirimahiga Factory\n合作社：Kiriti FCS\n品种：SL28/SL34/Ruiru11\n海拔：1650 米 masl\n烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n处理方式：水洗处理 Washed process\n风味：黑布林、蔓越莓、\n红布林、\n葡萄柚\nDark plum, Cranberry, Red plum,\nGrapefruit\n这只豆子是今年第一支让我感受到有花香的肯尼亚，它入口的第一感受不是那么的深色莓果果香，酸感也没有那种很饱满厚实，它的酸是很明亮明快的，更像是深色的核果像玫瑰李，蔓越莓、葡萄柚和红色李子的感受，然后有几次我还感受到了一些花香，很有层次，很干净细腻；\n特征关键词：\n深色核果+红色莓果核果+红色柑橘（有花香潜力）\nMuranga位于尼耶里，Kiambu，Embu和Kirinyaga的中间，被他们包围着\n关于\nKiriti\n合作社与\nKirimahiga\n处理厂\nKiriti合作社成立于1998年，位于肯尼亚中部的Muranga区域，距离Kangema镇17公里，距离首都Nairobi约110公里；下属3个处理厂，分别是Kayu, Gondo和Kirimahiga，总部位于Kayu处理厂；Kiriti合作社 总注册农户数近2500户，其中有近800多户小农提交咖啡果给Kirimahiga处理厂；\nKirimahiga周边的小农们每户平均种植近半公倾，200-300棵咖啡树，\n主要种植SL28/SL34，少量Ruiru11和Batian。\nDirect - 直接贸易\nAuction - 通过肯尼亚的生豆竞拍流程\n关于 SL / Ruiru11 / Batian\n注：以下内容翻译自Sucafina\nhttps://sucafina.com/na/news/think-you-know-kenya-coffee-varieties-think-again , 品种信息部分内容来自world coffee research\nSL的全称是\nScott Agricultural Laboratories (SAL)\n，是由当时英国殖民政府于1903年成立的农业研究机构，这个机构研究发布了现在我们耳熟能详的两个肯尼亚品种SL28和SL34；\nSL28和SL34仅是SAL在1930-1940年代发布\n的众多品种中的两个。由于具有深根特性，能最大限度利用稀缺水资源且无需灌溉即可茁壮成长，它们很快成为种植者的首选，替代了早期的波旁品种；\nSL品种很快遍布肯尼亚全境，尽管比波旁品种更抗咖啡叶锈病（CLR, Coffee Leaf Rust）和咖啡浆果病（CBD, Coffee Berry Disease），但SL品种仍易感这些疾病。随着咖啡产业发展，许多农场面临越来越严重的CLR和CBD疫情困扰。由于肯尼亚每年逢采收季必逢雨季，CBD侵袭成熟咖啡果的问题尤为严重。当肯尼亚咖啡研究所（CRI, Coffee Research Institute，肯尼亚独立后成立的咖啡研究组织接替SAL，地点在Ruiru镇）于\n1985年推出Ruiru11品种\n时，咖啡产业已做好变革准备。这种卡蒂姆与SL品种的杂交体兼具抗CBD和CLR特性，且种植密度远高于SL品种，能高效利用小面积土地。\nRuiru11逐渐在肯尼亚咖啡种植区推广开来。唯一的问题是浅根特性使其耐旱性较差，需要更精细的施肥方案。农民后来发现，通过将Ruiru11嫁接至SL植株上，既可利用SL发达的根系，又能获得Ruiru11的高产高抗病性；由于嫁接Ruiru11日益普及，如今肯尼亚大小农场都混种着Ruiru11与SL品种。随着SL树龄老化，更多农庄正转向Ruiru11（或嫁接方案），因其易管理且抗病性强。\nRuiru11的谱系构成比较复杂，它的父系血脉来源于两个方向：1-具有抗病能力的\nRume Sudan, Timor Hybrid lines和K7；2-具有较好杯品潜力的N39, SL28, SL34和Bourbon；母系血脉的考量是好打理的矮株和可以较高的种植密度，以及抗病性，最终一小部分Catimor被筛选出来作为母系血脉；\nBatian 巴天或者巴蒂安，这是肯尼亚咖啡研究所（CRI）2010年推出的新品种，以肯尼亚山最高峰命名，兼具抗CBD和CLR特性，还具有两年即可结果的早熟优势。虽然因植株结构等问题尚未大规模推广，但其普及度正在上升。\nBatian是从Ruiru11的父系植株的第五代里筛选出来的，所以它的基因组成即是：\n1-具有抗病能力的\nRume Sudan, Timor Hybrid lines和K7；2-具有较好杯品潜力的N39, SL28, SL34和Bourbon；\n关于处理\n在肯尼亚，处理过程简要如下：\n- 咖农采收鲜果\n- 采收当天，运送到处理厂；（摩托车，自行车，人力背运都有）\n- 在处理厂，先将鲜果做挑选；当处理厂的质量员批准后才可计重算作售卖；\n-很多小农的鲜果会集中一批进行去皮处理\n-去皮后的带着果胶的咖啡豆静置发酵（无水）\n-隔天进行水槽中的刷洗\n-二次浸泡（根据每个处理厂的习惯，可能有不同质量等级的做二次浸泡或者不做）\n-搬运至晒床晾晒\n-晾晒约2周左右，收储到处理厂的仓库中\n更详细的内容可以参考文章 产区 | 肯尼亚\n更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏淘宝店铺哦～\n公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content defaultNoSetting\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(171, 25, 66);\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RdCSII0CcFSqCUP0RnKE5ickwhrf74BbQIa7ic5wdP6aMhOE8DuRibDTO5mLt6rBqp6iaLnribQ6NY9MQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span>\n            基本信息\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-right-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.0980392);border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;\"/>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           国家：肯尼亚 Kenya\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           省份：中部 Central\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           区域：姆央噶 Muranga\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           处理厂：基里玛希噶处理厂 Kirimahiga Factory\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           合作社：Kiriti FCS\n          </span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           品种：SL28/SL34/Ruiru11\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           海拔：1650 米 masl\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           处理方式：水洗处理 Washed process\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           风味：黑布林、蔓越莓、\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            红布林、\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n           葡萄柚\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Dark plum, Cranberry, Red plum,\n          </span>\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            Grapefruit\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这只豆子是今年第一支让我感受到有花香的肯尼亚，它入口的第一感受不是那么的深色莓果果香，酸感也没有那种很饱满厚实，它的酸是很明亮明快的，更像是深色的核果像玫瑰李，蔓越莓、葡萄柚和红色李子的感受，然后有几次我还感受到了一些花香，很有层次，很干净细腻；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;caret-color: rgb(171, 25, 66);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          特征关键词：\n          <span style=\"color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: bold;\">\n           深色核果+红色莓果核果+红色柑橘（有花香潜力）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(171, 25, 66);color: rgb(171, 25, 66);text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(171, 25, 66);color: rgb(171, 25, 66);text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: auto;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: bottom;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(171, 25, 66);color: rgb(171, 25, 66);text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: auto;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: bottom;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RdCSII0CcFSqCUP0RnKE5icMxJiaZibZzGEE9J7icU4YhBkmGcV4nlazMTsOpo8wIS1juBiccHNGIPU6g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n            Muranga位于尼耶里，Kiambu，Embu和Kirinyaga的中间，被他们包围着\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             Kiriti\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n             合作社与\n            </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n              Kirimahiga\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n             处理厂\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.0980392);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Kiriti合作社成立于1998年，位于肯尼亚中部的Muranga区域，距离Kangema镇17公里，距离首都Nairobi约110公里；下属3个处理厂，分别是Kayu, Gondo和Kirimahiga，总部位于Kayu处理厂；Kiriti合作社 总注册农户数近2500户，其中有近800多户小农提交咖啡果给Kirimahiga处理厂；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           Kirimahiga周边的小农们每户平均种植近半公倾，200-300棵咖啡树，\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            主要种植SL28/SL34，少量Ruiru11和Batian。\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RdCSII0CcFSqCUP0RnKE5icoIiasqWibtrgUmb7OPgseFoxsNT8guGALYFVK5ibgWkYD6Ud2drgqYCww/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RdCSII0CcFSqCUP0RnKE5icibvo4qpgHmLeZO8BHibkauy1xUzBdcR0ZVSPVfJqibK5cD1rV2ht42cnw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RdCSII0CcFSqCUP0RnKE5iceArXwxH3tGywAMS7ZNaiaVEaF5KytYnKibEBeImQPdXa3qlxnfb3wichg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RdCSII0CcFSqCUP0RnKE5icOHQP1pVmCS0iaXUlrpNbKykYibjniaf2pjt4Vt9I1r5Anyo6NsdGbu8Hg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Direct - 直接贸易\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Auction - 通过肯尼亚的生豆竞拍流程\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           关于 SL / Ruiru11 / Batian\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;font-weight: normal;\">\n           注：以下内容翻译自Sucafina\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;font-weight: normal;\">\n           https://sucafina.com/na/news/think-you-know-kenya-coffee-varieties-think-again , 品种信息部分内容来自world coffee research\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           SL的全称是\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            Scott Agricultural Laboratories (SAL)\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            ，是由当时英国殖民政府于1903年成立的农业研究机构，这个机构研究发布了现在我们耳熟能详的两个肯尼亚品种SL28和SL34；\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n           SL28和SL34仅是SAL在1930-1940年代发布\n          </span>\n          的众多品种中的两个。由于具有深根特性，能最大限度利用稀缺水资源且无需灌溉即可茁壮成长，它们很快成为种植者的首选，替代了早期的波旁品种；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          SL品种很快遍布肯尼亚全境，尽管比波旁品种更抗咖啡叶锈病（CLR, Coffee Leaf Rust）和咖啡浆果病（CBD, Coffee Berry Disease），但SL品种仍易感这些疾病。随着咖啡产业发展，许多农场面临越来越严重的CLR和CBD疫情困扰。由于肯尼亚每年逢采收季必逢雨季，CBD侵袭成熟咖啡果的问题尤为严重。当肯尼亚咖啡研究所（CRI, Coffee Research Institute，肯尼亚独立后成立的咖啡研究组织接替SAL，地点在Ruiru镇）于\n          <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n           1985年推出Ruiru11品种\n          </span>\n          时，咖啡产业已做好变革准备。这种卡蒂姆与SL品种的杂交体兼具抗CBD和CLR特性，且种植密度远高于SL品种，能高效利用小面积土地。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;caret-color: rgb(0, 45, 49);color: rgb(0, 45, 49);font-family: \"Ideal Sans SSm A\", \"Ideal Sans SSm B\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18.4px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);float: none;display: inline !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Ruiru11逐渐在肯尼亚咖啡种植区推广开来。唯一的问题是浅根特性使其耐旱性较差，需要更精细的施肥方案。农民后来发现，通过将Ruiru11嫁接至SL植株上，既可利用SL发达的根系，又能获得Ruiru11的高产高抗病性；由于嫁接Ruiru11日益普及，如今肯尼亚大小农场都混种着Ruiru11与SL品种。随着SL树龄老化，更多农庄正转向Ruiru11（或嫁接方案），因其易管理且抗病性强。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Ruiru11的谱系构成比较复杂，它的父系血脉来源于两个方向：1-具有抗病能力的\n         </span>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n           Rume Sudan, Timor Hybrid lines和K7；2-具有较好杯品潜力的N39, SL28, SL34和Bourbon；母系血脉的考量是好打理的矮株和可以较高的种植密度，以及抗病性，最终一小部分Catimor被筛选出来作为母系血脉；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 17px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            Batian 巴天或者巴蒂安，这是肯尼亚咖啡研究所（CRI）2010年推出的新品种，以肯尼亚山最高峰命名，兼具抗CBD和CLR特性，还具有两年即可结果的早熟优势。虽然因植株结构等问题尚未大规模推广，但其普及度正在上升。\n           </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            Batian是从Ruiru11的父系植株的第五代里筛选出来的，所以它的基因组成即是：\n           </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n              1-具有抗病能力的\n             </span>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n               Rume Sudan, Timor Hybrid lines和K7；2-具有较好杯品潜力的N39, SL28, SL34和Bourbon；\n              </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</span>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            关于处理\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.0980392);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           在肯尼亚，处理过程简要如下：\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           - 咖农采收鲜果\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           - 采收当天，运送到处理厂；（摩托车，自行车，人力背运都有）\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           - 在处理厂，先将鲜果做挑选；当处理厂的质量员批准后才可计重算作售卖；\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           -很多小农的鲜果会集中一批进行去皮处理\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           -去皮后的带着果胶的咖啡豆静置发酵（无水）\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           -隔天进行水槽中的刷洗\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           -二次浸泡（根据每个处理厂的习惯，可能有不同质量等级的做二次浸泡或者不做）\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           -搬运至晒床晾晒\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           -晾晒约2周左右，收储到处理厂的仓库中\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SUmFynsJ8mZibzFwhDyicticjFTXlrJpJcjxiaqDStcT9MwwM2lMkcO9cZksLTz9doiaPlp0z12qhicDzA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<a class=\"normal_text_link\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU4MDQ4MDQ5OA==&amp;mid=2247483997&amp;idx=6&amp;sn=a18ff433ea7f792d4e6a6f3627f6b9d0&amp;chksm=fd577ec0ca20f7d6e696cf212cc39d2ba6d9b0a4a328ad712cc033336dbb1cd22f159001340d&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"\">\n            更详细的内容可以参考文章 产区 | 肯尼亚\n           </a>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px 0px 0em;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏淘宝店铺哦～\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;vertical-align: bottom;height: auto !important;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: 17px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
